itle=\"../batch10/58-df-ordclass.md\">../batch10/58-df-ordclass.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{OrdExp}:\\mathrm{Ord}^2\\to\\mathrm{Ord}\">\\(\\operatorname{OrdExp}:\\mathrm{Ord}^2\\to\\mathrm{Ord}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"f5a97ab309ebc2f7\" href=\"?note=f5a97ab309ebc2f7\" title=\"../batch14/58-df-ordexp.md\">../batch14/58-df-ordexp.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varepsilon_0\\in\\mathrm{Ord}\">\\(\\varepsilon_0\\in\\mathrm{Ord}\\)</span> (defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}epsilon0} \\vdash \\varepsilon_0\\coloneqq\\min\\{\\alpha\\in\\mathrm{Ord}:\\operatorname{OrdExp}(\\omega,\\alpha)=\\alpha\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}epsilon0} \\vdash \\varepsilon_0\\coloneqq\\min\\{\\alpha\\in\\mathrm{Ord}:\\operatorname{OrdExp}(\\omega,\\alpha)=\\alpha\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Thus <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega^{\\varepsilon_0}=\\varepsilon_0\">\\(\\omega^{\\varepsilon_0}=\\varepsilon_0\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varepsilon_0\">\\(\\varepsilon_0\\)</span> is the supremum of the finite tower sequence <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega,\\omega^\\omega,\\omega^{\\omega^\\omega},\\ldots\">\\(\\omega,\\omega^\\omega,\\omega^{\\omega^\\omega},\\ldots\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"df-epsilon0-—-$\\varepsilon_0$","text":"df-epsilon0 — $\\varepsilon_0$","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch16/58-df-omega.md","status":"resolved","id":"5045d216c83e75cb","anchor":"ref-1","targ